---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /blog/
title: "HVAC News & Advice | GMA Air Conditioning Blog"
description: "Expert HVAC advice, industry news and energy-saving tips from the GMA Air Conditioning team. Serving Edinburgh, Scotland & the North of England."
crumb: Blog
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Blog & insights</span>
    <h1>News, guides & updates</h1>
    <p>From the GMA team — air conditioning, ventilation, compliance, energy and beyond.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container grid grid--3">
    {%- for post in collections.posts %}
    <a class="card post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
      {% if post.data.image %}<img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy" style="border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:1rem;aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover;width:100%">{% endif %}
      <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | ukDate }}</time>
      <h2 class="h3" style="margin-top:.4rem">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
      <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
      <span class="card__link">Read more {% icon "arrow" %}</span>
    </a>
    {%- else %}
    <p>New posts coming soon.</p>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
